{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents29OUDSCircularProgressIndicatorV","title":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A circular indicator shows the progress of a task using a circle."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Useful when you need more visual focus or when space is limited."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Variants","level":2,"anchor":"Variants"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two variants are provided:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}]},{"text":": the caller provides a ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and reducing uncertainty."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (e.g. file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate completion time or percentage"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This helps inform users about the system state, reduces uncertainty, and prevents the interface from being perceived as unresponsive."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Statuses","type":"heading","text":"Statuses","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic loading,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing, synchronization or background tasks."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations, onboarding).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data retrieval).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be monitored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Gap size","anchor":"Gap-size"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"text":": standard gap between the indicator and the track (about 14° of arc).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}]},{"text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Track","anchor":"Track"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs a clear","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to read."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Animation-determinate-mode-only","text":"Animation (determinate mode only)","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), the determinate indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on first display, and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are always disabled when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"regardless of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" flag."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indeterminate mode is not affected by this flag: its Android Material 3 animation is intrinsic to the mode."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Helper text","anchor":"Helper-text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional text displayed below the circular indicator to provide context or additional information."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The helper text is always centered under the indicator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"},{"type":"text","text":" which offers two variants:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".percent(_:)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description. The percentage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value and its "},{"code":"%","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. "},{"code":"\"75%\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in English, "},{"code":"\"75 %\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in French, "},{"code":"\"٪75\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in Arabic)."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is a simple "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Determinate - default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation on display)","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status and no track","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, status: .accent, track: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status and a small gap","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3, status: .warning, gapSize: .small)","","    \/\/ Determinate displayed instantly at its target value, without any animation","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, animated: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with percentage and description","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  helperText: .percent(\"of 100 MB\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                  accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                  helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator()","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info, helperText: \"Processing...\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.state","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"VoiceOver reads: ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]"}]},{"text":". Example: ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage) so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"VoiceOver reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait so that assistive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"technologies know the value is changing.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}]},{"type":"text","text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a progress"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trait is used."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view is hidden from VoiceOver ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".accessibilityHidden(true)"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation: there is no readable value to expose and keeping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element focusable would only pollute navigation."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are disabled when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","type":"heading","text":"Colored surfaces","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}]},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-circular-progress-indicator","type":"reference"}]},{"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","level":2},{"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Orange","type":"image"}]},{"anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact"}]},{"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Sosh","type":"image"}]},{"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Wireframe","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Version","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"name":"Since","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"3.0.0","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:gapSize:animated:size:helperText:accessibility:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:accessibility:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/defaultSize"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"],"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSCom